{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/HeptaTorch/pulls/23","id":5333086803,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVvZx0M8AAAABPeByUw","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/HeptaTorch/pull/23","diff_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/HeptaTorch/pull/23.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/HeptaTorch/pull/23.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/HeptaTorch/issues/23","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/HeptaTorch/pulls/23/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/HeptaTorch/pulls/23/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/HeptaTorch/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/HeptaTorch/issues/23/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/HeptaTorch/statuses/9a20eadbe20a801c8b26727ae369e0ee0832e423","number":23,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"test: observe pinned incoming gradient materialization","user":{"login":"ProfHepta","id":102159240,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhbTiA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102159240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta","html_url":"https://github.com/ProfHepta","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ProfHepta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Purpose\n\nFreeze real observations from the locked PyTorch 2.15.0+cpu wheel for public gradient Tensor ownership, incoming-gradient materialization, edge ordering, Bernoulli zero-gradient layouts, mixed zero/nonzero accumulation and exact scalar-add NaN behavior. These are reference probes; they do not execute HeptaTorch or establish native API parity by themselves.\n\n## Frozen probes and actual observations\n\n| Reference scope | Fixed probe SHA-256 | Actual report SHA-256 | Actual run |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Incoming-gradient materialization: 16 families / 25 variants | `8706090d731cf705e68a2e474693d10448b1fa00371ca8ddd5db36163500bd69` | `e4a83999c853f07d14a7db2fceafef664ca6d92151b5da4f5252972c690dc044` | 43825736114 |\n| Gradient aliases and edge order: 12 variants | `cc0392888f0db9f7026c3f24e0787845b60e43b5e18d8c63cdcb8c720d51acd5` | `4c9fce4425e401281b2f6d6a19b9bd6dedec250baa144a9cbc956a452d72b43a` | 43829156325 |\n| Bernoulli gradient layout and alias lifetime: 8 cases | `f43ba1d1cc220c76279e3c8f96fb1358ce421e9f309d209bcdb5a5dbc554f718` | `07bc446c10d37f942b1c3a6917b869874100c4d9ebc71622245f3505198f1eda` | 43836311359 |\n| Mixed zero/nonzero gradient: both creation orders | `3f8c8c6b3d8bb86cdbfe574ab92ac2c43f6817e3b6cc32b1f4e48957cd8816ae` | `72150ed1d2a1792f2d16be85b4b3bd323bafa8b20d2a6b7f23218682eda63f43` | 43837881805 |\n| Scalar-add NaN: 12 families × 4 widths/layouts, 48 variants | `bd4660bf02d32e175d8c9802c09f2dcc93b4f589d06749ae43645544fb76936a` | `e664c9ff717a104b8c7317dfc55677e0248e58f981cb8315eacb3975049048ff` | 43837881805 |\n\nThe scopes stay separate; their counts are not summed into unique upstream API coverage. Every actual report retains the exact reference environment and all eleven provenance checks. The earlier fixed 183-distribution and original public-gradient probes are byte-identical.\n\n## Original-byte evidence\n\nRun 43836311359 / job 133193694607 completed 32 successful steps. Its 19-report artifact 14211635360 is retained losslessly under `validation/bernoulli-gradient-layout/hosted-b376bb0/` (ZIP SHA-256 `957e7ddaa4c75f7e4c2d9a4ba00873f3ec7d90e10c3094a6a6260975099221ea`).\n\nRun 43837881805 / job 133198958743 completed 40/40 steps on source head `c36c54a11f85c38fa7a1a4740c721bfa0d06372d`, checkout `59befbbb7691e56fc2241e60d4d11c477a00fc53`, tree `ff71ba78c59c86897474e0d5fe4197230af4da19`. Both new probes have zero probe errors. Artifact 14212481580 contains all 23 original reports and the manifest, satisfying 22 explicit report envelopes. The ZIP is 384,624 bytes, SHA-256 `0637c73be7bf5a8451121dd3880deb81b1c7dce57df585a7c95dd403152202ce`. Every member's original bytes, size and hash were checked. This complete evidence and admission receipt are committed under `validation/gradient-adam-distributions-reference/hosted-c36c54a/`.\n\n## Observation boundaries and integration\n\nTensor and Storage identifiers remain opaque within each process. Identity relationships and mutation-linked Version changes are checked separately from equal numeric counters. Mixed-gradient observations retain all forward-intermediate layouts as well as leaf/seed/gradient values, identities, Versions and full Generator states. Scalar-add observations retain NaN signs/payloads/quieting and record the requested binary32 scalar, its Python binary64 conversion and its admitted binary32 value; no NaN canonicalization or tolerance was introduced.\n\nCurrent integration head `9a20eadbe20a801c8b26727ae369e0ee0832e423` merges the separately qualified main `e4cf7b6d3645b5a340ec3b47489ecc326e908c13`, retaining the complete 68-step native workflow and all frozen probe bytes. Exact-head hosted checks for this integration are pending and are not inferred from predecessor runs. All existing reference steps remain and every complete report is exported even when observations fail.\n\nThe original support SHA is `ef8fe89aa7dbff4ee03f9d5762d2736a3648d9e48e97ad5df7bec615676f04ae`; the lock SHA is `ca2e54ce65083bbe0ab3d47b6878971271765ab35a9dd70725fa345fceed3944`. Hooks/create_graph and all other observed-but-unimplemented behavior stay open. The whole-project decision remains HOLD, with the unchanged 2,590-schema denominator and no inferred full-schema parity.\n\n\n## Extreme singleton-stride reference\nAn additional frozen eight-case probe (`568ece8996db71f5d1a16b6dfb71efd963a258f457e73cfdc738f7d60e226f89`) observes real admission and pointwise layout at signed byte-stride boundaries. Each backing store contains only six float32 elements; the large stride belongs to an axis of size one. It records accepted results or actual exceptions without predicting overflow behavior.\n\nExact-head reference run 43842245575 / job 133213530745 has completed 44/44 steps. Its eight observations are all OBSERVED with zero probe errors and all eleven provenance checks. The exact report is 35,100 bytes, SHA-256 `2de8fbd82d10fc16b0640684f4b36ae958a5a0455773401f82092210967137c8`. Artifact 14213701692 preserves 25 original reports and the manifest, satisfying 24 report envelopes; its ZIP is 389,929 bytes, SHA-256 `c52993dd041daf0a6d512e361341934368708309f79efe01b7d70edb17dff2a7`. The checkout was bb7288e4a764716c20ff92064265dd27f1219a3e with tree 5519a9f84b9768e8dcf9ff041ddd1d5969f3bcbc. Complete native checks for this head remain separately required before admission.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-16T07:42:48Z","updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:46:43Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"bb7288e4a764716c20ff92064265dd27f1219a3e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"TrillionniumFoundation:feature/gradient-materialization-observations","ref":"feature/gradient-materialization-observations","repo":{"id":1458991568,"node_id":"R_kgDOVvZx0A","name":"HeptaTorch","full_name":"TrillionniumFoundation/HeptaTorch","owner":{"login":"TrillionniumFoun